    "title": "Five Iron Golf Opens First Connecticut Location - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Five Iron Golf announced the grand opening of its first Connecticut location in South Norwalk in the Sono 50 building at 50 Washington Street. The 8,500-square-foot venue features 10 Trackman simulators that players to envision playing at more than 400 golf iconic worldwide courses including Pebble Beach and St. Andrews. The simulators also offer advanced multi-angle swing-capture technology for video analysis of a player’s swing. Read full article\n1",
